1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Cosmic Graveyard of Dead Stars - Asteroid Field, Mysterious longing, cautious hope, growing apprehension.

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:12,300
Lyra: Another dead star. Another echo, fainter than the last.

3
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:17,600
Kael: The Silence gnaws at the edges, Lyra. We are running out of time.

4
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,900
Lyra: But not out of stories. Not yet.

5
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:29,200
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Cosmic Graveyard - Memory Anchor Nexus, Urgency, growing apprehension, faint hope.

6
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,500
Kael: There. The resonance is strong. This is it.

7
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,800
Lyra: The Anchor. So fragile, for something so vital.

8
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:40,100
Kael: It holds the threads. Threads of what you seek. Of *us*.

9
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:48,400
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Anchor Nexus - Core Chamber, Hope, then dawning suspicion and apprehension.

10
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:51,700
Lyra: I feel it... a surge. A fragment!

11
00:00:51,1000 --> 00:00:53,1000
Lyra: It's… vibrant. A piece of *me*.

12
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,300
Kael: ...

13
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,600
Lyra: Kael? You're quiet.

14
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:03,900
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Anchor Nexus - Exterior, Tense desperation, overwhelming threat.

15
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:06,200
Kael: It's here. The Silence.

16
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:08,500
Lyra: So soon? It felt… distant.

17
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:12,800
Kael: It always comes for the light. For the memories.

18
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:15,100
Lyra: Not this one. Not today.

19
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:22,400
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Anchor Nexus - Battle Zone, Desperate struggle, fleeting breakthroughs.

20
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:24,700
Lyra: It's too fast! I can't…

21
00:01:24,1000 --> 00:01:27,1000
Kael: Connect! Feel the shard. Let it guide you!

22
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:30,300
Lyra: Pain… so much pain!

23
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,600
Lyra: No! This is *mine*!

24
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:39,900
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Anchor Nexus - Battle Zone, Shock, betrayal, devastation.

25
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,200
Lyra: We're losing ground! Kael, the core!

26
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:43,500
Kael: I… I can't.

27
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:45,800
Lyra: What are you saying? Move!

28
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:51,100
Kael: That shard… it wasn't yours. Not entirely. I planted it. A lure.

29
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:58,400
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Anchor Nexus - Battle Zone, Emotional devastation, desperate resolve.

30
00:01:58,700 --> 00:01:59,700
Lyra: You… what?

31
00:01:59,1000 --> 00:02:03,1000
Kael: I had to! To draw it out! To protect… something else!

32
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:07,300
Lyra: Lies. All of it. You fed me lies!

33
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,600
Lyra: You are the Silence.

34
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:17,900
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory Anchor Nexus - Core Chamber, Desperate victory, profound personal cost.

35
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:22,200
Lyra: No. Not my story. Not my identity. Not yours to take!

36
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:24,500
Lyra: This pain… it's real. It's *mine*!

37
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,800
Kael: Lyra…

38
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:33,100
♪ at dawn, in Memory Anchor Nexus - Aftermath, Devastating grief, cold anger, broken trust.

39
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,400
Lyra: Don't speak. Not to me.

40
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:36,700
Kael: I regret…

41
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Lyra: Regret doesn't mend what you broke. It doesn't bring back what I thought I found.

42
00:02:44,300 --> 00:02:50,300
♪ at dawn, in Memory Anchor Nexus - Solitary Reflection, Reluctant acceptance, resolute but solitary determination.

43
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:55,600
Lyra: The truth is a jagged thing. It cuts, but it also defines.

44
00:02:55,900 --> 00:03:00,900
Lyra: My identity… it is not what I expected. But it is mine.

45
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:03,200
Lyra: Our paths diverge, Kael. For good.

46
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:10,500
♪ in broad daylight, in Cosmic Graveyard - Departure Point, Resolute but solitary determination, bittersweet hope.

47
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:15,800
Lyra: The void remembers. And now, so do I. Every lie, every truth.

48
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:22,100
Lyra: This journey… it was never about finding a fixed self. It was about forging one.
